-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §27 מורה במשרה חלקית: the part-time week —
-- the floor of a third of a position and its exceptions, the position of a
-- teacher on a sabbatical or partial unpaid leave, the hours of a part-time
-- teacher by the annexed tables, several schools, and a part-time mother's
-- and age hours.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `27 מורה במשרה חלקית`
    @ref akn:art_27__para_g akn:art_27__para_h akn:art_27__para_i akn:art_27__para_ja
    GIVEN `the hours annexes א and ב give` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO `work week`
          `the hours annexes ג and ג1 give` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO `work week`
          `the part-time mother's week the annexes give` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO `work week`
          `the part-time age reduction the annexes give` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER

-- akn:art_27 The opening: the part-time week, set out in (א)–(יא).

DECLARE `part-time teacher kind` IS ONE OF
    `an existing teacher`
    `a new teacher`
    `a new special-education teacher`
    `a paramedical or integrating teacher`

@desc A part-time teacher, as far as §27(א)–(ה) ask.
DECLARE `part-time teacher` HAS
    kind                                   IS A `part-time teacher kind`
    `position fraction`                    IS A NUMBER
    `position in the year before the school moved` IS A NUMBER @desc for an existing teacher (27(ב))
    `approved by the head of teaching personnel` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a new teacher below 50% (27(ג))

-- (א): not below a third of a position, subject to what follows; (ב): an
-- existing teacher employed between a third and 50% the year before the
-- school moved may move at that position or more; (ג): a new teacher (not
-- in special education) not below 50% unless the head of teaching personnel
-- approved the employment and its week; (ד): a new special-education
-- teacher not below a third; (ה): a paramedical or integrating teacher may
-- be employed below a third.
@ref akn:art_27__para_a akn:art_27__para_b akn:art_27__para_c akn:art_27__para_d akn:art_27__para_e
GIVEN t IS A `part-time teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position is allowed under section 27` t IF
    CONSIDER t's kind
    WHEN `an existing teacher` THEN
            t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1/3
        AND (   t's `position in the year before the school moved` GREATER THAN 0.5
             OR t's `position fraction` AT LEAST t's `position in the year before the school moved`)
    WHEN `a new teacher` THEN
            t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.5
        OR  (t's `approved by the head of teaching personnel` AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1/3)
    WHEN `a new special-education teacher` THEN t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1/3
    WHEN `a paramedical or integrating teacher` THEN t's `position fraction` GREATER THAN 0

-- (ו): on a sabbatical or partial unpaid leave, a position below a third is
-- the weekly frontal hours divided by all the weekly hours of a full
-- position (36, §§15 and 17).
@ref akn:art_27__para_f
GIVEN `weekly frontal hours` IS A NUMBER, `weekly hours of a full position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position on a sabbatical or partial unpaid leave` `weekly frontal hours` `weekly hours of a full position` IS
    `weekly frontal hours` DIVIDED BY `weekly hours of a full position`

-- (ז): from a third of a position up, the weekly hours are in proportion to
-- the full-position hours of §§15 "עד" a word processor's error message
-- and "23" — a corpus sic (its note: the agreement of 29.2.2012 rewrote the
-- range as §§15 to 18 and 21 to 23); taken as §§15 to 23. The hours
-- themselves are those of the annexed tables א' and ב', which the corpus
-- does not publish with the agreement: an input.

GIVEN w IS A `work week`, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part-time weekly hours in proportion` w `position fraction` IS
    `hours of the week` w TIMES `position fraction`

-- (ח): paramedical and integrating teachers below a third of a position in
-- a school, and teachers in several reform schools (a third or more in
-- all) below a third in one of them by the personnel division's approval,
-- work there by the tables of annexes ג' and ג1' — an input.

-- (ט): a part-time mother's week, with the stay-hours reduction, is by
-- annexes א' and ב'; (יא): so is a part-time teacher's age reduction.

-- (י): in several schools, the hours are computed for each school apart.
@ref akn:art_27__para_j
GIVEN `positions in each school` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `work week`
DECIDE `the hours for each school` `positions in each school` IS
    map `the hours annexes א and ב give` `positions in each school`

#ASSERT `the position on a sabbatical or partial unpaid leave` 6 36 EQUALS 1/6
#ASSERT `the part-time weekly hours in proportion` (`a week of` 26 5 5) 0.5 EQUALS 18
`a new teacher at 40% without approval` MEANS
    `part-time teacher` WITH
        kind IS `a new teacher`
        `position fraction` IS 0.4
        `position in the year before the school moved` IS 0
        `approved by the head of teaching personnel` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the position is allowed under section 27` `a new teacher at 40% without approval`
